<title>USA: Muni fund outflows totaled $149 mln - AMG.</title>
<headline>Muni fund outflows totaled $149 mln - AMG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMG Data Services said $149 million flowed out of municipal bond funds for the week ended March 19.</p>
<p>The Arcata, Calif., firm said the drop represents a 0.08 percent decline in flows versus the previous week. The week ended March 12 saw $250 million flow into municipal bond funds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
